            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_ziF69K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>A Transformational Journey into Joy, Presence & Oceanic Wisdom</strong></p><p>Step into a world where time slows down, the water glows crystalline turquoise, and the wild dolphins of Bimini invite you into their playground of pure joy, intelligence, and heart-centered presence. In this intimate, life-changing retreat, your guides Anne Gordon and Jillian Rutledge will lead you into conscious, respectful, and deeply soulful encounters with the resident Atlantic spotted dolphins.</p><p>This is more than a retreat.</p><p>It is a passageway into play, flow, unity, and unconditional love — the frequency dolphins live by and teach so gracefully.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
