        "dropdown_m6Bgrp": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 2 · Monday, June 15, 2026",
            "text": "<p><strong>Travel to Bimini & First Dolphin Encounter</strong></p><p>Fly together to the island of Bimini, settle into WildQuest Retreat Center, enjoy orientation, and head out on the boat for your first magical meeting with the wild dolphins.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anne_dolphin_itinerary1.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#023e8a",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_ybWNAH": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 3 · Tuesday, June 16, 2026",
            "text": "<p><strong>Swim with the Dolphins</strong></p><p>Enjoy a morning of ease before heading out on the catamaran for a full day of connection, snorkeling, play, and deep presence with the dolphins. Evening meditation and wisdom circle.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anne_dolphin_itinerary3.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#0077b6",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
