          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 4 · Wednesday, June 17, 2026",
            "text": "<p><strong>Celebrate with the Dolphins</strong></p><p>Another beautiful day on the water with the dolphins, followed by an evening out on the island for dinner and dancing with your retreat community.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anne_dolphin_itinerary6.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#0096c7",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_LQRUQw": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 5 · Thursday, June 18, 2026",
            "text": "<p><strong>Swim with the Dolphins</strong></p><p>A day devoted to ocean exploration, dolphin encounters, and integrating their teachings of joy, flow, and unity. Evening gathering and meditation.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anne_dolphin_itinerary5.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#0077b6",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
