        "dropdown_WfUBR8": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 6 · Friday, June 19, 2026",
            "text": "<p><strong>Farewell Dolphin Journey</strong></p><p>Your final dolphin swim invites gratitude, reflection, and heartfelt connection as you soak in the last full day on the water. Closing circle in the evening.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anne_dolphin_itinerary2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#023e8a",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_zkKE87": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Day 7 · Saturday, June 20, 2026",
            "text": "<p><strong>Departure from Bimini</strong></p><p>Say goodbye to the island and your new pod of friends as you fly back to Ft. Lauderdale, carrying the dolphins’ joy and wisdom home with you.</p>",
