    "text_and_image_pQtyM7": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Anne_Gordon_Headshot_with_ocean_beach.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "Retreat Leader",
        "title": "Anne Gordon",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<h5>Dolphin & Whale Wisdom Teacher</h5><p>For over 18 years, Anne has guided transformational dolphin and whale retreats in some of the most magical waters on earth. Known for her gentle presence, deep cetacean connection, and ability to translate dolphin/whale wisdom into practical and spiritual guidance, she creates a safe and sacred field where participants consistently experience joy, heart-opening healing, and emotional freedom.</p><p>Anne has spent her entire life observing dolphins and whales starting with orca whales as a child on her family's boat in the Pacific NW. She has a degree in biology and animal behavior so understands the physical, behavioral and spiritual meanings of the dolphins and loves to share it with you.</p><p>With her background as a dolphin energy healer and her lifelong relationship with the sea, Anne weaves together intuitive guidance, ocean wisdom, energy alignment practices, and soulful teaching to help you receive the full blessing of your dolphin encounters.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_EjxEcp": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Jillian_Rutledge_Beach.png",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Jillian Rutledge",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<h5>Professional Freediving Instructor · Breathwork Specialist · Dolphin-Initiated Guide</h5><p>Jillian’s relationship with the dolphins runs deep — spanning more than 20 years, thousands of hours in the ocean, and an awakening that began when she first worked as a dolphin trainer. It was the dolphins who taught her that freedom is a state of mind and a vibration of spirit, far more than a physical circumstance.</p><p>They showed her how to consciously breathe.</p><p>They initiated her into the codes of transmutation.</p><p>And they awakened in her a profound remembrance of power, joy, and her inner dolphin-ness.</p><p>Since then, Jillian has communed with dolphins and whales across the world’s oceans, deepening her connection through breath-hold diving, intuitive communication, and underwater dancing. The Bimini dolphins—her earliest open-ocean teachers—have been guiding her since 2002.</p><p>Today she lives in the Pacific Northwest, spending time with orcas, humpbacks, harbor porpoises, and Pacific white-sided dolphins. As a professional freediving instructor, breathing specialist, performance coach, and intuitive ocean guide, Jillian helps people return to their power, joy, and natural vitality — remembering how to breathe the way dolphins breathe, and how to move through life with fluidity and freedom.</p><p>Her presence on this retreat adds a transformational dimension: the art of breath as a bridge into connection, embodiment, and dolphin consciousness.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "right",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
