    "testimonials_bJRN8t": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_6zBKJ3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Swimming with dolphins has been a lifelong dream, and finding Anne while searching for whale wisdom felt divinely aligned. I spent months daydreaming about being in the water with them — but this retreat was beyond anything I could have imagined. Every day was pure magic.</p><p>Anne has a gift for expanding the wonder of every moment and helping you absorb the deeper meaning of the experience. I’m going home as a whole new me. This retreat was truly life-changing.</p>",
            "author": "Lindsay Keane",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_kW8aWV": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>This Bimini retreat has been absolutely amazing — there are no words for how transformative swimming with dolphins can be. They take you deep into yourself.</p><p>Anne leads with compassion, joy, and a genuine love for the dolphins, creating a space of unity and harmony. I joined her Gray whale retreat in Mexico, which changed my life, and Bimini took me to an even deeper level.</p><p>If you get the chance, come. You’ll be welcomed with love from day one.</p>",
            "author": "Linda Johns",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_efMU68": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>This retreat was magical — deeply empowering in ways I never expected. I released fear, rediscovered my strength, and broke through old self-doubt.</p><p>Anne is calm, grounded, and wonderfully open. She guides when needed yet gives you space to explore your own experience. I’m leaving with more than I ever imagined.</p>",
            "author": "Sue Barrett",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_cnwUg7": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Coming to Bimini was a big leap — I hadn’t taken a personal vacation in 14 years as a caregiver. But when Anne introduced us to our dolphin spirit guides in a workshop, I knew I had to meet mine in person.</p><p>I’m so glad I came. It has been heartfelt, healing, and deeply moving. I’ve made lifelong friends — both human and dolphin — and I know I’ll find my way back.</p>",
            "author": "Arlene Ashera",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_7YBVKX": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I’ve been traveling with Anne for nearly 15 years — Panama, Mexico, and now three years in a row with the dolphins of Bimini. Every trip is special.</p><p>There’s no guarantee of sightings, but what I’ve learned is that once the human pod comes together, the dolphins come too — often and joyfully.</p><p>As a single female traveler, I always feel completely safe and welcomed. Anne attracts kind, compassionate people, and the experience is always exceptional.</p>",
            "author": "Jean Guthrie",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
